{"3284780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mahjong Realms", "steam_appid": 3284780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4257760], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Realms is the same mahjong solitaire you're familiar with, but with unique, polished visuals and a built-in puzzle editor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles spanning three campaigns, each with its own unique setting. Every realm offers a distinct visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/c0878727304205b57302e2044de7b96c.avif?t=1781283803\" width=1240 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm is brought to life with custom music tracks and striking visuals, creating a deep, immersive atmosphere that evolves with your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/2965f05c38b578ff891fb9e7e790124d.avif?t=1781283803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras_big/2965f05c38b578ff891fb9e7e790124d.webp?t=1781283803 width=1560 height=1300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Architect New Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own puzzles with the intuitive editor and share them on the Steam Workshop. Browse a growing collection of player-made layouts for endless replayability and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/f6ef384a4d807a7d70468a389aa43c53.avif?t=1781283803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras_big/f6ef384a4d807a7d70468a389aa43c53.webp?t=1781283803 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four shuffle algorithms, ranging from the order of a guaranteed solvable path to the chaos of pure random distribution, as well as many other settings to fine-tune your experience, provide you with plenty of opportunity to play casually or master the art of mahjong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/45d23b52a57ddd3d3030d5b65b0a8c64.avif?t=1781283803\" width=1280 height=836 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Realms is the same mahjong solitaire you're familiar with, but with unique, polished visuals and a built-in puzzle editor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles spanning three campaigns, each with its own unique setting. Every realm offers a distinct visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/c0878727304205b57302e2044de7b96c.avif?t=1781283803\" width=1240 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm is brought to life with custom music tracks and striking visuals, creating a deep, immersive atmosphere that evolves with your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/2965f05c38b578ff891fb9e7e790124d.avif?t=1781283803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras_big/2965f05c38b578ff891fb9e7e790124d.webp?t=1781283803 width=1560 height=1300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Architect New Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own puzzles with the intuitive editor and share them on the Steam Workshop. Browse a growing collection of player-made layouts for endless replayability and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/f6ef384a4d807a7d70468a389aa43c53.avif?t=1781283803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras_big/f6ef384a4d807a7d70468a389aa43c53.webp?t=1781283803 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four shuffle algorithms, ranging from the order of a guaranteed solvable path to the chaos of pure random distribution, as well as many other settings to fine-tune your experience, provide you with plenty of opportunity to play casually or master the art of mahjong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/extras/45d23b52a57ddd3d3030d5b65b0a8c64.avif?t=1781283803\" width=1280 height=836 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The classic tile matching game reimagined with strange and striking new visuals. Unlock new themes as you progress. Browse the Steam Workshop for player-made puzzles, or craft and share your own!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/f51a3779d9865fb5d71996690edbb47418e29364/header.jpg?t=1781283803", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/9eff27bea3139144e4e7ec028c7c6f6a31de1098/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781283803", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/9eff27bea3139144e4e7ec028c7c6f6a31de1098/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781283803", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<